AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill provides a limited license exemption for certain supportive housing options for
individuals with disabilities located within a larger facility or apartment building. The bill also
clarifies that community living facilities certified by the department of health and human services
arenotexemptfromstateandlocalzoningandsafetyordinances.

